#   escaped-backslash-pipe five-column note | id | arm | path | verdict | witness |, C01 row bytes
#                          `| C01 | fixture arm | C:\\|KILLED | differs |` (two backslashes then
#                          the cell boundary; GFM reads backslash + separator).
#   two-hyphen-delimiter   fixture note | id | arm | verdict | witness | with delimiter
#                          `|--|--|--|--|`.
#   double-pin             counter copy with decoy `SELF_SHA256 = "000...0"` inserted BEFORE the
